    <title>PGA DAC-ADC External Loopback</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_PGA_EX1_DAC_ADC_EXT_LOOPBACK_1md__home_siddharth_ti_repos_c29_sdk_docs_docs_src_docs_api_guide_examples_drivers_pga_ex1_dac_adc_ext_loopback"/></para>
<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_PGA_EX1_DAC_ADC_EXT_LOOPBACK_1autotoc_md431">
<title>Introduction</title>
<para>This example generates 800 mV using the CMPSSDAC output. CMPSSLITE is used route the low DAC output to an external pin to be used as an external DAC. The output of the CMPSSLITE DACL is externally connected to PGA for 2x gain amplification. It uses two ADC channels to sample the CMPSSDAC output and the amplified voltage output from PGA. The ADC is connected internally to these signals.</para>
<para>Watch Variables<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>dacResult - The DAC output voltage.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>pgaResult - The amplified DAC voltage.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>pgaGain - The ratio of the amplified DAC voltage to the original DAC output. This should always read a value of ~2.0.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="EXAMPLES_DRIVERS_PGA_EX1_DAC_ADC_EXT_LOOPBACK_1autotoc_md432">
<title>External Connections</title>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Connect CMPSSLITE_DACL_OUT (Analog Pin A0) to PGA1_INP1 (Analog Pin A11)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connect PGA1_INM1 (Analog Pin A4) to GND</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
